The Portuguese rules, examples, modes, terminology guidance and regression
corpus were adapted and extended for pt-PT. This is not an official upstream
localisation and is not a literal translation.

Comparative review also consulted the WikiProject AI Cleanup guidance and public
humanizer projects in English, pt-BR and pt-PT. Their approaches were used as
research references; the pt-PT rules and examples in this repository were
independently reviewed for context, false positives and factual preservation.
